  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether-overworld-ores\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fAll_rights_reserved\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets license-All Rights Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/Overworld-Ores/blob/1.21.1-develop/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-LGPL v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=TheAetherTeam&type=patrons&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/118816101936267265.svg?label=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&logo=discord&color=7289DA&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/twitter-@DevAether-lightgrey?style=flat-square&logo=twitter&color=1DA1F2&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmastodon.gamedev.place%252f%2540DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/mastodon/follow/110581810287361848?domain=https://mastodon.gamedev.place/&style=flat-square&logo=mastodon&logoColor=white&label=mastodon&color=858AFA\" alt=\"Mastodon\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&logoSource=feather&style=flat-square&color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.threads.net%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/threads-devaether-green?logo=instagram-threads&style=flat-square&color=000000\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.facebook.com%252fAetherMod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/facebook-AetherMod-blue?logo=facebook&style=flat-square&color=1877F2&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/devaether-instagram?color=D50060&label=instagram&logo=instagram&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@devaether-tiktok?color=000000&label=tiktok&logo=tiktok&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&label=youtube&logo=youtube&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theaetherteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/theaetherteam?logo=twitch&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&label=reddit&logo=reddit&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&style=flat-square&color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>⛏️ 關於此附加模組 ⛏️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>Overworld Ores 附加模組&nbsp;<strong>實作了新的原初石礦石變體</strong>&nbsp;對應<strong>原版與模組礦石</strong>，並將&nbsp;<strong>在天域維度中自然生成</strong>&nbsp;其生成率與分佈範圍與主世界的對應礦石相似。模組礦石變體僅在安裝了包含該礦石的對應模組時才會生成。本附加模組無法涵蓋所有模組礦石的相容性，但整合包作者可以建議希望新增的其他礦石。</p>\n<p>本附加模組旨在協助尋求將特定礦石區塊加入天域而不需要玩家前往主世界開採的整合包作者，例如用於僅限天域的生存模式情境。整合包作者也可以使用數據包自訂所有預設功能，例如生成率或合成配方結果。</p>\n<p>目前支援的相容性包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>錫礦；<em>Thermal Foundation、Railcraft、Mekanism</em>。</li>\n<li>鉛礦；<em>Thermal Foundation、Railcraft、Mekanism、Embers、Immersive Engineering</em>。</li>\n<li>銀礦；<em>Thermal Foundation、Railcraft、Embers、Immersive Engineering</em>。</li>\n<li>鎳礦；<em>Thermal Foundation、Railcraft、Immersive Engineering</em>。</li>\n<li>鋅礦；<em>Railcraft、Create</em>。</li>\n<li>鈾礦；<em>Mekanism、Immersive Engineering</em>。</li>\n<li>硫礦；<em>Thermal Foundation、Railcraft</em>。</li>\n<li>Create 模組的礦石粉碎配方。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/overworldOres0.png\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 來自 Aether Team 的更多作品 ☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>如果您對本附加模組有任何疑問，或只是對 Aether Team 開發的其他專案感興趣，歡迎加入 The Aether Project 的 Discord！我們友善的工作人員和熱情的社群會讓您有賓至如歸的感覺！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p>您也可以透過在 Patreon 上贊助來支持 Aether Team！每一筆贊助都將直接投入於遊戲開發，讓我們能繼續從事最熱愛的事業。<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
